<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Ssangyong Paper H1 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ssangyong Paper H1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   345  vs 649</p>
<p>    Net					  1.61  vs 2.91</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			2.15  vs 4.29</p>
<p>    Revenue				  151.43  vs 149.38</p>
<p>NOTE - Ssangyong Paper Co Ltd, a unit of the Ssangyong Group, is one of South Korea's leading paper producers. It also produces sanitised papers. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
